title: Two files made by another program two seconds apart both get a card
folders: edit-odd
limit: 50
expect-log: updated 'made_first\.txt' \(made\) alone in
expect-log: updated 'made_second\.txt' \(made\) alone in
expect-log: script: 14 files on the canvas, \d+ cards
expect-log: script: the layout, the symbol index and the dependencies are what building them again gives
forbid-log: scanning again

wait 3000
touch made_first.txt one
wait 2000
touch made_second.txt two
wait 6000
left files
wait 500
mark both-made
wait 400
goto made_second.txt
wait 1500
mark second-selected
wait 400
count
quit
